Description: Remverse is a meta-package that provides a single entry point for relational event modeling by re-exporting core functions from 'remify', 'remstats', and 'remstimate'. Supports tie-oriented, actor-oriented, and duration models with frequentist, Bayesian, regularized, and mixture-based estimation.
